' ===== 实体间关联 =====
Station "1" *-- "0..*" Charger : 包含
Station --> StationStatus
Charger --> ChargerType
Charger --> ChargerStatus
User --> UserRole
ChargeRecord --> RecordStatus
ChargeRecord --> DeductionStatus
Payment --> PaymentStatus
Repair --> RepairStatus

User "1" --> "0..*" ChargeRecord : 发起
Charger "1" --> "0..*" ChargeRecord : 被使用
Charger "1" --> "0..*" Repair : 产生
  note on link #orange : 用户提交报修时充电桩关联到报修单\n报修关闭/解决后充电桩恢复 idle
User "1" --> "0..*" Payment : 支付
User "1" --> "0..*" Repair : 报修/处理
ChargeRecord "1" --> "0..1" Payment : 产生
User "0..1" --> "0..*" AuditLog : 操作记录
  note on link #orange : AuditLog actor_id 可为 NULL（系统操作）\nactor_type=system 时无对应 User 记录

